### 12. Filtering Map Keys by Prefix (`startsWith`)

* **Question:** Iterate through a `TreeMap` of departments and print only the names of the departments that start with the letter `"C"`.
* **Answer:**
```java
TreeMap<String, String> map = new TreeMap<>();
map.put("Physics", "Dr. H. J. Bhabha");
map.put("Mathematics", "Dr. C. S. Seshadri");
map.put("Computer Science", "Dr. A. K. Choudhury");
map.put("Chemistry", "Dr. C. N. R. Rao");

for(Map.Entry<String, String> i : map.entrySet()) {
    if(i.getKey().startsWith("C")) {
        System.out.println(i.getKey()); // Prints Chemistry and Computer Science
    }
}

```
